{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 50, :comments ["<b>And we bring near his offering.</b> Rashi explained: it is brought in tractate Shabbat — 'If we escaped the sin of transgression, we did not escape the sin of improper thought.' And even though a beautiful woman is permitted even for relations, one may say that this is specifically for the first act of relations and with one woman only, but two — and even one — from the first act onward is forbidden, even in thought."], :book :numbers, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:10:26.399471461Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}